WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:04.317
Jack flew at Roxy. She ducked to avoid the kick.

2
00:00:04.318 --> 00:00:07.180
Jack attacked again with a wide kick.

3
00:00:07.181 --> 00:00:10.015
This time Roxy jumped out of the way.

4
00:00:10.016 --> 00:00:14.262
Jack continued attacking, but Roxy dodged every punch and kick.

5
00:00:14.263 --> 00:00:17.161
"Grr." Spike made a fist.

6
00:00:17.162 --> 00:00:21.244
"The rest of you—attack!" he called to the other students.

7
00:00:21.245 --> 00:00:25.367
Suddenly all of the students began attacking Roxy at once.

8
00:00:25.368 --> 00:00:27.671
They punched and kicked her from all directions.

9
00:00:27.672 --> 00:00:30.792
One jumped on top of Roxy, then so did another.

10
00:00:30.793 --> 00:00:33.830
All the students started piling on top of her.

11
00:00:33.831 --> 00:00:36.587
"Ugh!" Roxy struggled hard.

12
00:00:36.588 --> 00:00:39.355
But the kids held her down so she couldn't move.

13
00:00:39.356 --> 00:00:41.275
The driver started the moving van.

14
00:00:41.276 --> 00:00:43.930
Spike ran to the passenger side.

15
00:00:43.931 --> 00:00:47.021
He climbed in, and the truck started driving away.

16
00:00:47.022 --> 00:00:51.590
Roxy squirmed. The students' grip was starting to feel weaker.

17
00:00:51.591 --> 00:00:55.308
"Are the amulets losing their power?" she thought.

18
00:00:55.309 --> 00:00:57.583
Roxy spotted Jack on the pile.

19
00:00:57.584 --> 00:00:59.780
She managed to free one of her arms.

20
00:00:59.781 --> 00:01:04.974
She reached up and grabbed the amulet from Jack's neck. "Help!"

21
00:01:04.975 --> 00:01:12.620
"Huh?" Jack climbed off the pile and shook his head.

22
00:01:12.621 --> 00:01:17.372
"Rocket Girl?" he mumbled. "Is that you?"

23
00:01:17.373 --> 00:01:20.720
"Yes! Get these kids off me!"

24
00:01:20.721 --> 00:01:23.762
Jack started pulling students off Roxy.

25
00:01:23.763 --> 00:01:27.143
By now the sensei was far away from the studio. The

26
00:01:27.144 --> 00:01:30.297
amulets had no more power. "Where

27
00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:33.542
am I?" a girl asked. "Am

28
00:01:33.543 --> 00:01:39.285
I still at karate class?" another kid mumbled. Roxy

29
00:01:39.286 --> 00:01:41.799
shot up from the ground. "Thanks!

30
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:45.928
Now I have to get the Jade Dragon vase back!" Roxy

31
00:01:45.929 --> 00:01:48.133
flew after the van. Spike

32
00:01:48.134 --> 00:01:50.682
looked back and saw Roxy. "Speed

33
00:01:50.683 --> 00:01:53.689
up!" he cried to the driver. Roxy

34
00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:56.578
flew ahead of the van and landed in the road. She

35
00:01:56.579 --> 00:01:59.129
held up her hand for the van to stop. The

36
00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:03.136
driver put his foot on the gas. Vroom! He

37
00:02:03.137 --> 00:02:05.811
drove right at Roxy! Crunch!

38
00:02:05.812 --> 00:02:11.958
The truck's front end crumpled around Roxy's hand. "You're

39
00:02:11.959 --> 00:02:19.917
both under arrest!" Roxy picked up the van and flew it to jail. ***

40
00:02:19.918 --> 00:02:27.782
The next day Roxy and her friends were back at Sunshine Karate.

41
00:02:27.783 --> 00:02:33.303
"I can't believe that sensei brainwashed you, Jack," Mara said.

42
00:02:33.304 --> 00:02:36.811
"Good thing Rocket Girl stopped him," Terrell said.

43
00:02:36.812 --> 00:02:39.830
"I used to think using karate to fight was cool."

44
00:02:39.831 --> 00:02:42.936
Jack shook his head. "Not anymore."

45
00:02:42.937 --> 00:02:46.836
"Learning how to defend yourself is a good idea," Roxy said.

46
00:02:46.837 --> 00:02:50.175
"Just be careful who you learn it from."

47
00:02:50.176 --> 00:02:58.124
Jack nodded and did a goofy spinning kick.

48
00:02:58.125 --> 00:03:05.946
Roxy laughed. "We don't want to learn karate from you!"

